---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import FinalDoorCTA from "../components/FinalDoorCTA.astro";
import { entity } from "../data/entity";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Reviews: Check Us on BBB and Trustpilot"
  description="We don't publish our own reviews. Here's where to read what real, independent third parties say about us."
>
  <section class="bg-navy-900 text-offwhite-100">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-4">REVIEWS</p>
      <h1 class="on-navy">Check us before you trust us</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg opacity-90">
        We won't put review quotes on this page ourselves. Reviews only mean something when you can trace
        them back to an independent source, so that's exactly what this page links to.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-ivory-50">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-14">
      <h2>Why we link out instead of quoting in</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
        Anyone can put five stars and a nice sentence on their own homepage. That proves nothing. Real
        reviews live on independent platforms where anyone, including someone who never gave us a dollar,
        can leave an honest rating. This is where we're reviewed, and this is where you should go read them
        directly, not just take our word for the summary.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-navy-100">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-14">
      <h2 class="mb-8">Where to find us</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="card bg-white p-6">
          <span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-navy-100 text-navy-600 mb-4" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.5-3 8-7 10-4-2-7-5.5-7-10V6z"/><path d="M9.5 12l1.8 1.8L14.5 10"/></svg>
          </span>
          <p class="font-serif font-semibold text-lg">Better Business Bureau (BBB)</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">
            Our BBB profile, complaint history, and accreditation status, straight from BBB's own site.
          </p>
          {entity.bbbUrl ? (
            <a href={entity.bbbUrl} class="mt-4 inline-block font-semibold text-navy-700 hover:text-gold-500" data-cta="reviews-bbb" rel="noopener">
              View our BBB profile &rarr;
            </a>
          ) : (
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm italic text-slate-500">[NEEDS CONFIRMATION: BBB profile URL]</p>
          )}
        </div>
        <div class="card bg-white p-6">
          <span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-navy-100 text-navy-600 mb-4" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3l2.6 5.6 6.1.6-4.6 4.2 1.3 6-5.4-3.1-5.4 3.1 1.3-6-4.6-4.2 6.1-.6z"/></svg>
          </span>
          <p class="font-serif font-semibold text-lg">Trustpilot</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">
            Independent, unfiltered reviews from clients, good and bad, directly on Trustpilot's platform.
          </p>
          {entity.trustpilotUrl ? (
            <a href={entity.trustpilotUrl} class="mt-4 inline-block font-semibold text-navy-700 hover:text-gold-500" data-cta="reviews-trustpilot" rel="noopener">
              View our Trustpilot profile &rarr;
            </a>
          ) : (
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm italic text-slate-500">[NEEDS CONFIRMATION: Trustpilot profile URL]</p>
          )}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-ivory-50">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-14">
      <h2>What we won't do on this page</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
        We won't show a star rating or an aggregate score here until it's pulled directly from a real,
        sourced set of reviews on BBB or Trustpilot. No invented quotes, no rounded-up averages, nothing
        that isn't checkable the moment you click through.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
        Looking for author stories instead of third-party ratings? Those live on our
        <a href="/case-studies" class="underline font-semibold">case studies page</a>, under the same rule:
        real and permissioned, or clearly marked as pending. And if a claim anywhere on this site ever
        mentions results or income, the honest context is always one click away on our
        <a href="/disclaimer" class="underline font-semibold">disclaimer page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <FinalDoorCTA />
</BaseLayout>
